Cell["References: A. Cabello, arXiv:1210.2988 (Graph-theoretic Exclusivity principle). J. Ulrey, IJQF 8 (2022) 31-116 = arXiv:2001.09756 (operational taxonomy). Source of all recomputed facts above: BlackBox/Kernel/BlackBox.wl, 00-BBT-blackbox-protocol/PROPOSITION-O3.md, 00-BBT-blackbox-protocol/BlackBoxCertifier.wl.", "Text"]

}, Open  ]]

